OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CTeenager charged after Sean Graham     
OL,5,Cbookmakers memorial damaged            
OL,6,GAn 18-year-old man has been charged    
OL,7,Gwith offences including criminal       
OL,8,Gdamage after a memorial in south       
OL,9,GBelfast was vandalised.                
OL,11,FPaint was thrown over a plaque         
OL,12,Fdedicated to the victims killed in the 
OL,13,FSean Graham bookmakers attack.         
OL,15,FFive people were murdered in the       
OL,16,FUlster Defence Association attack on   
OL,17,Fthe Ormeau Road in 1992. Seven other   
OL,18,Fpeople were injured.                   
OL,20,FThe man is expected to appear before   
OL,21,FBelfast Magistrates' Court on 18       
OL,22,FDecember.                         G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
