OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,C'Nightmare' to save as average semi-   
OL,5,Cdetached house price hits 19-year high 
OL,6,GThe average price of a semi-detached   
OL,7,Ghouse in Northern Ireland has exceeded 
OL,8,Gthe level last reached in 2007 before  
OL,9,Gthe property crash.                    
OL,11,FIn the third quarter of this year the  
OL,12,Faverage price was #209,953, compared   
OL,13,Fto #205,169 in the third quarter of    
OL,14,F2007.                                  
OL,16,FThe effects of inflation means that    
OL,17,Fhouses are still substantially cheaper 
OL,18,Fin real terms today. For example,      
OL,19,Faverage full time wages in NI are now  
OL,20,Fabout 70% higher in cash terms         
OL,21,Fcompared to 2007.                      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
